     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Just did a build and spot check with Java 7 update 6 (build 1.7.0_06-b24). All tests pass, and spot-check turned up no issues.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I put out a call on the users list for folks to help w/ testing Java 7. If nothing turns up in the next week of testing, I vote we close this issue as fixed.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
