     },
     "body": "<p>After adding additional JDK7-required methods to the various java.sql wrappers/mock classes, I was able to successfully compile Fedora and run Fedora with OpenJDK 7 for OS X while still supporting Sun/Oracle JDK 6 for OS X.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/commit/f29e9aa1cdae55db58382fc642790bf5c50696db\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/fcrepo/fcrepo/commit/f29e9aa1cdae55db58382fc642790bf5c50696db</a></p>",
     "created": "14/Oct/11 7:34 PM",
